          "type": "text",
          "text": "Field researchers considered salt exposure near the coast while preparing a capacity check for the solar farm equipment cover. Cable trays run beneath the protective equipment cover. The design must also be explained clearly in the safety briefing. A spherical model has diameter 12 cm. Find its volume in cm³, correct to 1 decimal place."
        }
      ],
